 "text": "Benton County, MN | Official Website\nLoading\nSkip to Main Content\n-->\nHow Do I...\nServices\nCommunity\nGovernment\nSearch\nCareers\nPayments\nMaps\nContact Us\nAgendas & Minutes\nNotify Me\nSheriff's Office\nGovernment Center Project\nCourt Calendar\nDMV (Hours M-F 8am-4pm)\nCampground and Park Reservations\nProperty Viewer Map (Beacon)\nWatch County Board Meeting\nCounty Ditches\nMNBenefits\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nNews & Calendar\nStay up to date\nDewey Street Closure\nDewey Street in Foley on the South side of the Benton County Government Center will be closed for approximately one week starting Tuesday, October 13th. Read on...\nFood Waste Reduction & Composting Grant\nBecome a local food waste warrior! The Tri-County Solid Waste Commission has launched a community grant program where eligible small businesses, non-profits, schools, and municipalities can apply for ... Read on...\nBenton County Launches New Agenda Management System\nBenton County is excited to announce the launch of its new Agenda Management System, making it easier for the public to access County Board meeting agendas, packets, and related meeting information. Read on...\nSCORE TIRE Grant Application\nDo you have any unwanted tires lying around? Read on...\nView All News\n/CivicAlerts.aspx\nOct\n20\nCounty Board Regular Meeting\nOct\n28\nBoard of Adjustment Special Meeting\nPlanning Commission Special Meeting\nNov\n3\nCounty Board Regular Meeting\nNov\n6\nBoard of Canvass - General Election\nView Full Calendar\n/Calendar.aspx\nContact Us\nBenton County Government Center\n531 Dewey Street\nP.O. Box 129\nFoley, MN 56329\nPhone: 320-968-5000\nQuick Links\nPay Your Property Taxes Online\nGovernment Center Project (Live Cam)\nWatch a County Board Meeting\nAgendas and Minutes\nWho's My Commissioner?\nCounty Parks\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nSite Links\nSite Map\nSalary Compliance Notice\nContact Us\nAccessibility\nCopyright Notices\nPrivacy Policy\nHome\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nGovernment Websites by Civic